#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md:3
#: dde660a9d9884118b405d0267e1ba416
msgid ""
"Basic Joint Controller (`basic_joint_controller`) is a joint-position "
"controller with a three-state FSM (HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ). Optional "
"dexterous-hand switch/percent control and optional waist lifting/turning."
msgstr ""
"`Basic Joint Controller`（`basic_joint_controller`）是带三状态 FSM（HOME / HOLD /"
" MOVEJ）的关节位置控制器。可选灵巧手开关/比例控制，以及可选腰部升降/转向。"

